WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.680
Hey guys,
If you're looking for good,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:07.200
sound biblical teachings in truth&nbsp;
- in love - and through the Spirit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:14.280
that's not preaching to itchy ears, just what&nbsp;
people's fleshly natures want to hear, but sound&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:20.840
biblical doctrine - then join DLM Men's Lifestyle.
This is the men's ministry you're looking for.&nbsp;

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:24.880
And this is some of what you&nbsp;
can expect to see and hear.&nbsp;

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:29.080
If you're lost, if you're trying to make sense of&nbsp;
the world, trying to make sense of your purpose.&nbsp;

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:33.760
Why you are here, what is your meaning,&nbsp;
then you need to understand that you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:41.360
can only find the answers in truth itself.
And God himself who created you in His image.&nbsp;

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:48.760
You are not just some random mistake.
You are created in God's image for a purpose.&nbsp;

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:53.440
And He's waiting for you to&nbsp;
near Him, with all your heart.&nbsp;

00:00:53.440 --> 00:01:01.160
Trying to get rich quick often leads to financial&nbsp;
ruin because you're doing that... you're walking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:04.600
in your own will, your own desires.
Fleshly desires.&nbsp;

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:08.160
You're not walking in God's will.
We need to work hard for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:12.200
money that we receive.
You need to earn it.&nbsp;

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:18.520
Many of you still look back on your failures and&nbsp;
you're letting it define who you are. There was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:23.760
definitely a flood and we don't just read that&nbsp;
from the Bible, but from other civilizations.&nbsp;

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:27.520
Not just two or three, but&nbsp;
almost from all of them.&nbsp;

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:30.720
It says that we have to be watchful.
Are you?&nbsp;

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.160
Are you always on guard, looking out?
Because we are in a battle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.760
whether you like it or not.
And you need to be watchful.&nbsp;

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:40.400
You need to be careful.
You need to be on guard, being able&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:46.800
to see when evil is attacking you or your family.&nbsp;
You also need to be able to discern, to watch out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:51.720
there in the world, to see what darkness is doing.
We will all die someday.&nbsp;

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:59.840
You might even die soon.
And then where will you go when you die?&nbsp;

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:10.680
This life is not all there is.
And I want you to be with me in eternal life.&nbsp;

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:13.360
Man, it would be so special if&nbsp;
I can talk to some of you guys.&nbsp;

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:18.840
We might never meet in this life but&nbsp;
in the life after this one, for sure.&nbsp;

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:25.320
God was saying to me - choose me or choose&nbsp;
your dad - and you need to understand my dad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:29.800
was everything for me.
He was my role model.&nbsp;

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:32.400
Excuse me.
My pillar.&nbsp;

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:36.400
It wasn't easy.
God was saying choose me.&nbsp;

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:44.560
Am I everything to you or do you choose your dad?
It was the same thing He asked Abraham to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:51.480
sacrifice his son Isaac,
The test to put Him first.&nbsp;

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:58.760
That is the day I fully surrendered to Christ.
I went to China and that is where God told me&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:04.000
to become a preacher, to share His&nbsp;
gospel to the ends of the world.&nbsp;

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:08.480
You see, David did not fight through&nbsp;
the flesh with his own power.&nbsp;

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:13.440
He fought with God's power that&nbsp;
was in him, through the Spirit.&nbsp;

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:18.680
You see, He did not have self-confidence.
He had God-confidence.&nbsp;

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:21.880
You know, I've been called vain&nbsp;
as well when I was younger.&nbsp;

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:25.160
And here's the truth.
I was.&nbsp;

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:32.360
I was vain until God opened my spiritual eyes&nbsp;
and I saw myself for what I was, at that time.&nbsp;

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:38.120
A wretched arrogant human being.
I felt like the worst person ever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:42.920
when God showed me my pride.
Put God first in your marriage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:46.600
in everything that you do.
It is God's Word that says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:52.120
that you have to love your wife, not&nbsp;
when you feel like it - it's a command.&nbsp;

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:56.880
It's an act of your will, not just a feeling.
The feeling a lot of people focus on - that kind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.400
of love - is the eros love.
Sexual love.&nbsp;

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:02.720
The attraction love.
There's also agape love, which is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:07.480
unconditional love that God has for us.
That's the love that you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:11.680
also have to have for your wife.
To love her even when you don't feel like it.&nbsp;

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:16.400
When we become reborn Christians,&nbsp;
we receive a new spiritual nature.&nbsp;

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.840
The Holy Spirit, right?
So we have that nature.&nbsp;

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:24.160
We also still have that old sinful flesh and&nbsp;
when we act through the Spirit, we will not sin.&nbsp;

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:28.840
This new nature helps us to overcome sin,&nbsp;
but when we don't act through the Spirit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:32.840
when we act through the flesh, we will sin.
We will fall.&nbsp;

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:38.800
And so not only do we receive the new spiritual&nbsp;
nature, we also become children of God.&nbsp;

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:45.480
He adopts us after He declared us as righteous.
But that doesn't mean that when we sin He will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:50.680
just think, okay, that's fine and just leave it.
He disciplines us as a good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:55.680
father because He loves us.
You can trust God with everything in you.&nbsp;

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:59.760
But you cannot always trust people.
People ... you need need to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:04.280
be very careful in who you trust.
But you can trust God because He knows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.880
what's going on in your life anyway.
He knows everything.&nbsp;

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:15.040
So you need to be vulnerable to Him especially.
But you don't need to be vulnerable to all people.&nbsp;

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:20.920
Evil is taking over is certain areas&nbsp;
causing suffering that's unnecessary,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:25.920
because we are supposed to be the light in&nbsp;
the world to help the poor - to help the weak.&nbsp;

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:31.320
But a lot of Christian men are doing nothing.
You are called to be the light of the world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:36.400
and to go and make disciples&nbsp;
of all people. Do you get it?&nbsp;

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:42.840
This world can do what it wants to you, but&nbsp;
if your confidence is in God, you will always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:45.760
have peace and joy.
It's like the tree.&nbsp;

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.920
You know, the rain can come.
The storms can come.&nbsp;

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:54.000
The sun can beat in the day, but&nbsp;
the roots are in the living water.&nbsp;

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:58.560
Join us by subscribing to our channel, where&nbsp;
you can expect to see weekly videos that you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:04.600
can watch - that you can share - and that you&nbsp;
can comment on with the rest of the DLM family.&nbsp;

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:08.480
This world, and the things of&nbsp;
this world, it's all passing away.&nbsp;

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:11.560
We're in this world but&nbsp;
we're not part of this world.&nbsp;

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:17.040
So join us by putting Christ first&nbsp;
and always remember, life is short.&nbsp;

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:20.960
So don't waste yours.
Bye.

